    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/extras/55fdb1f0be851956ec6a8fabf0439cfa.avif?t=1747378403\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nonogram Nonsense</i>] is a pure logic puzzle game for players who crave challenge without clutter. Solve procedurally generated nonogram puzzles \u2014 number-based logic grids that reveal abstract patterns, not images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Puzzle of the Day</strong> and <strong>Endless\u00a0 Generation</strong>, there\u2019s always something new to solve. Clean, minimal design keeps the focus where it belongs: on the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle of the Day</strong> \u2013 A new random puzzle seeded daily  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267e\ufe0f Unlimited Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Generate and solve endlessly  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Smart Generation</strong>] \u2013 Always solvable with logic, never guesswork  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Accessible Design</strong> \u2013 Straightforward interface with no clutter  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u23f1\ufe0f Optional Timer</strong> \u2013 For those who enjoy racing the clock  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Focused Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Minimal menus, no ads, no microtransactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/extras/55fdb1f0be851956ec6a8fabf0439cfa.avif?t=1747378403\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nonogram Nonsense</i>] is a pure logic puzzle game for players who crave challenge without clutter. Solve procedurally generated nonogram puzzles \u2014 number-based logic grids that reveal abstract patterns, not images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Puzzle of the Day</strong> and <strong>Endless\u00a0 Generation</strong>, there\u2019s always something new to solve. Clean, minimal design keeps the focus where it belongs: on the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle of the Day</strong> \u2013 A new random puzzle seeded daily  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267e\ufe0f Unlimited Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Generate and solve endlessly  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Smart Generation</strong>] \u2013 Always solvable with logic, never guesswork  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Accessible Design</strong> \u2013 Straightforward interface with no clutter  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u23f1\ufe0f Optional Timer</strong> \u2013 For those who enjoy racing the clock  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Focused Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Minimal menus, no ads, no microtransactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
